---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProtectedEmail from '../components/ProtectedEmail.astro';

---

<BaseLayout title="About">
 
  <p class="about-greeting">Hello all 👋</p>
  
<p>
  I'm a software testing consultant and team lead at <a class="content-link" href="https://www.noesis.pt/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Noesis</a>, with extensive experience helping teams deliver quality software.
</p>

<p>
  I began as a hands-on tester, breaking things across different technologies, environments and devices, from big desktop screens to small mobile ones. Along the way, I picked up API testing
  and automation with tools like Postman, SoapUI, Selenium, Robot Framework, Cypress and Playwright.
</p>

<p>
  Because quality starts with conversation, I try to bring BDD in early, so business, development and testing build a shared understanding before a single line of code is written. That's the heart of my shift-left
  mindset: catching problems when they're cheapest to fix, and ideally before they exist.
</p>

<p>
  These days, I'm also taking my first steps in bringing AI into my testing work, curious to see how it can help teams test smarter, not just faster.
</p>

<p>
  I'm ISTQB CTFL and ITIL certified, but I'm just as shaped by a stubborn curiosity about why things break. This is where I write about all of this.
</p>

  <p><strong>Outside of work:</strong> music, guitar and classical literature.</p>

  <p>
    Got a question? Spotted a broken link, or anything else that looks off? Let me know, I'd
    appreciate it.
  </p>

  <p>
    In case you need me ✨<br />
    <ProtectedEmail email="hugfil@gmail.com" />
  </p>

  <section class="worked-with">
    <h2 class="worked-with-label">Worked With</h2>
    <div class="worked-with-grid">
      <div class="logo-card">
        <img src={`/grupo-pinero_logo.svg`} alt="Grupo Piñero" />
      </div>
      <div class="logo-card">
        <img src={`/mbcp_logo.svg`} alt="Millenium BCP" />
      </div>
      <div class="logo-card">
        <img src={`/f3m_logo.svg`} alt="F3M Information Systems, S.A." />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>